request.description:
SignalR Hub connection. Use Postman's SignalR request type instead of HTTP.

Connection URL: ws://localhost:{port}/hubs/tracking?access_token={token}

Methods:
- JoinRideGroup(rideId) — subscribe to ride updates
- LeaveRideGroup(rideId) — unsubscribe
- UpdateLocation(rideId, lat, lng) — driver broadcasts position
- RideStatusChanged(rideId, status) — broadcast status change

Server events:
- LocationUpdated: { rideId, latitude, longitude, timestamp }
- StatusChanged: { rideId, status, timestamp }
